              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha akatoa mkate, andazi la tende na andazi la zabibu kavu kwa kila mtu katika mkutano wote wa Waisraeli, wanaume kwa wanawake. Nao watu wote wakaenda nyumbani kwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
